\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_eleanor_rigby_ep-960x942.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/norway_yellow_submarine/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_yellow_submarine-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Yellow Submarine/Eleanor Rigby single artwork - Norway\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_yellow_submarine-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_yellow_submarine-578x580.jpg 578w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_yellow_submarine-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_yellow_submarine.jpg 715w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9858\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/norway_yellow_submarine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_yellow_submarine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"715,717\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yellow Submarine/Eleanor Rigby single artwork \u2013 Norway\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_yellow_submarine.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/italy_yellow_submarine/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxOTgiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTk4IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"198\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_yellow_submarine-198x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Yellow Submarine/Eleanor Rigby single artwork - Italy\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_yellow_submarine-198x200.jpg 198w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_yellow_submarine-575x580.jpg 575w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_yellow_submarine-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_yellow_submarine.jpg 711w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 198px) 100vw, 198px\" data-attachment-id=\"9544\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/italy_yellow_submarine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_yellow_submarine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"711,717\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yellow Submarine/Eleanor Rigby single artwork \u2013 Italy\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_yellow_submarine.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/germany_yellow_submarine/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_yellow_submarine-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Yellow Submarine/Eleanor Rigby single artwork - Germany\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_yellow_submarine-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_yellow_submarine-580x576.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_yellow_submarine-960x953.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_yellow_submarine-768x763.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_yellow_submarine-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_yellow_submarine.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9456\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/germany_yellow_submarine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_yellow_submarine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,993\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yellow Submarine/Eleanor Rigby single artwork \u2013 Germany\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_yellow_submarine-960x953.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/brazil_yellow_submarine/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_yellow_submarine-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Yellow Submarine/Eleanor Rigby single artwork - Brazil\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_yellow_submarine-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_yellow_submarine-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_yellow_submarine-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_yellow_submarine-768x767.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_yellow_submarine-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_yellow_submarine.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9196\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/brazil_yellow_submarine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_yellow_submarine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,999\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yellow Submarine/Eleanor Rigby single artwork \u2013 Brazil\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_yellow_submarine-960x960.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_89 ez-toc-wrap-right counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction\"><div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\"><p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Contents</p>\n<span class=\"ez-toc-title-toggle\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle Table of Content\"><span class=\"ez-toc-js-icon-con\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"eztoc-hide\" style=\"display:none;\">Toggle</span><span class=\"ez-toc-icon-toggle-span\"><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"list-377408\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" class=\"arrow-unsorted-368013\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10px\" height=\"10px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.2\" baseProfile=\"tiny\"><path d=\"M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 eztoc-toggle-hide-by-default' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/eleanor-rigby/#Personnel\" >Personnel</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"#In_the_studio\" >In the studio</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"#Chart_success\" >Chart success</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"In_the_studio\"></span>In the studio<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p>Recording began on <a href=\"/1966/04/28/recording-eleanor-rigby/\">28 April 1966</a>. With a score by <a href=\"/people/george-martin/\">George Martin</a>, and inspired by the music written by Bernard Herrmann for the Truffaut film <em>Farenheit 451</em>, no Beatles played on the record. Instead a closely-miked string octet was recorded in 14 takes, after which Paul overdubbed his lead vocals.</p><blockquote><div>The violins backing was Paul&#8217;s idea. <a href=\"/people/jane-asher/\">Jane Asher</a> had turned him on to Vivaldi, and it was very good, the violins, straight out of Vivaldi. I can&#8217;t take any credit for that, a-tall.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">John Lennon, 1980<br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/allwearesaying\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>All We Are Saying</em></a>, David Sheff</div><p>On <a href=\"/1966/04/29/recording-mixing-eleanor-rigby-im-only-sleeping/\">29 April</a> McCartney added more vocals, and he, Lennon and Harrison provided harmonies. The song was then considered complete until <a href=\"/1966/06/06/recording-mixing-and-your-bird-can-sing-for-no-one-im-only-sleeping-tomorrow-never-knows-eleanor-rigby/\">6 June</a>, when Paul added one more vocal part.</p><blockquote><div>George Martin had introduced me to the string quartet idea through <a href=\"/songs/yesterday/\">&#8216;Yesterday&#8217;</a>. I&#8217;d resisted the idea at first, but when it worked I fell in love with it. So I ended up writing &#8216;Eleanor Rigby&#8217; with a string component in mind. When I took the song to George, I said that, for accompaniment, I wanted a series of E minor chord stabs. In fact, the whole song is really only two chords: C major and E minor. In George&#8217;s version of things, he conflates my idea of the stabs and his own inspiration by Bernard Hermann, who had written the music for the movie <em>Psycho</em>. George wanted to bring some of that drama into the arrangement. And, of course, there&#8217;s some kind of madcap connection between Eleanor Rigby, an elderly woman left high and dry, and the mummified mother in <em>Psycho</em>.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Paul McCartney<br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/mccartneylyrics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>The Lyrics: 1956 To The Present</em></a></div><p>George Martin&#8217;s score was released in 1996 unadorned by vocals, on <a href=\"/albums/anthology-2/\"><em>Anthology 2</em></a>. The song also appeared in remix form on the <a href=\"/albums/love/\"><em>Love</em></a> album.</p><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Chart_success\"></span>Chart success<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p>The double a-side single &#8216;Eleanor Rigby&#8217;/<a href=\"/songs/yellow-submarine/\">&#8216;Yellow Submarine&#8217;</a> was released in the UK on <a href=\"/1966/08/05/uk-single-eleanor-rigby-yellow-submarine/\">5 August 1966</a>, the same day as <a href=\"/albums/revolver/\"><em>Revolver</em></a>.</p><p>The single entered the charts on 10 August at number two. The following week it reached the top, where it remained for four weeks.</p><p>In America it fared less well. Released on <a href=\"/1966/08/08/us-single-eleanor-rigby-yellow-submarine/\">8 August 1966</a>, it charted at number 11 and spent six weeks in the top 40.</p><p>The US single peaked at number two on the <em>Billboard</em> Hot 100 and <em>Cashbox</em> charts; this has been attributed to the downbeat subject matter, and also the fallout from John Lennon&#8217;s &#8220;<a href=\"/1966/03/04/how-does-a-beatle-live-by-maureen-cleave/\">more popular than Jesus</a>\u201d comments.</p><p>&#8216;Eleanor Rigby&#8217; was nominated for three Grammy awards in 1966, and won the Best Contemporary Rock and Roll Vocal Performance, Male.</p><div class=\"fab-forum-link\"><a href=\"/fab-forum/the-songs/eleanor-rigby/\">Discuss &#8216;Eleanor Rigby&#8217; on the Fab Forum \u00bb</a></div><div class=\"wp-post-navigation\"><div class=\"wp-post-navigation-pre\"> <strong>Previous song:</strong> <a href=\"/songs/taxman/\">&#8216;Taxman&#8217;</a></div><div class=\"wp-post-navigation-next\"> <strong>Next song:</strong> <a href=\"/songs/im-only-sleeping/\">&#8216;I&#8217;m Only Sleeping&#8217;</a></div></div><div align=\"center\" style=\"clear:both;margin:15px 0;\"></div><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/eleanor-rigby/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></span></div>",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-10-25"
}